{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Forge, Fight, and Flourish!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to <strong>Forgedale</strong>, an immersive RPG where farming meets adventure! Build your homestead, battle formidable bosses, complete epic quests, mine for rare resources, and craft powerful gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565700/extras/bacf5410d3deb67c4e8b7e27c3e49c56.avif?t=1771342509\" width=368 height=114 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Packed Combat</strong>\u00a0: Face off against challenging bosses and monsters in the ever-changing dungeon. Wield powerful weapons and magic to defeat your opponents!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Farming System</strong>\u00a0: Grow crops, raise animals, and manage your land to thrive in this  world. Discover rare ores, gather resources, and craft legendary weapons, armor, and tools.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests &amp; Exploration</strong>\u00a0: Embark on thrilling quests, uncover hidden secrets, and explore the diversity of the land teeming with adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression &amp; Customization</strong>\u00a0: Level up your character, unlock abilities, and tailor your playstyle to become the ultimate adventurer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Are you ready to farm, fight, and forge your destiny?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app